## chart main Eli-Me Maker Flow
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  maker["Public eli-me-maker skill"]
  placement["Placement decision"]
  ask["Ask-cascade calibration"]
  map["MMDX preference map"]
  private["Private eli-me skill"]
  validate["Validate and activate"]

  maker --> placement
  placement --> ask
  ask --> map
  map --> private
  ask --> private
  private --> validate
```

## chart ask-cascade-detail Ask-Cascade Calibration
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  root["Root style fork"]
  complete["Completion axis"]
  example["Example type"]
  compression["Compression"]
  checkpoint["Checkpoint cadence"]
  card["Preference card"]

  root --> complete
  complete --> example
  example --> compression
  compression --> checkpoint
  checkpoint --> card
```

## chart mmdx-map-detail MMDX Preference Map
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  need["Use only when a map clarifies the preference"]
  axes["Axes: start shape, proof type, compression, checkpoints"]
  private["Write private preference maps beside eli-me"]
  public["Keep public diagrams generic"]

  need --> axes
  axes --> private
  axes --> public
```

## chart private-skill-detail Private Skill Boundary
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  maker["Public maker"]
  template["Generic template"]
  answers["Private calibrated answers"]
  skill["Private eli-me/SKILL.md"]
  link["Optional workspace activation"]

  maker --> template
  template --> skill
  answers --> skill
  skill --> link
```
